ERC-8004: Trustless Agents — registry contracts, specification and ABIs

This directory contains the work of the ERC-8004 team, taken from
https://github.com/erc-8004/erc-8004-contracts with its commit history.

ERC-8004 is a community effort coordinated by Marco De Rossi (MetaMask) and
Davide Crapis (Ethereum Foundation), with the co-authorship of Jordan Ellis
(Google) and Erik Reppel (Coinbase). The core team is joined by Leonard Tan
(MetaMask), Vitto Rivabella (Ethereum Foundation) and Isha Sangani
(Ethereum Foundation). Specification: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004

